  "stem": "On Monday, Amy said, \"I am busy.\" On Friday, Ben reports her words as Amy said that she was busy. What time does was busy show?",
  "options": [
    "Only Friday after lunch",
    "Every day of Amy's life",
    "A future time after Friday",
    "The time when Amy spoke on Monday"
  ],
  "answerIndex": 3,
  "optionRationales": [
    {
      "optionIndex": 0,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "Friday 是 Ben 的轉述時間，不是 was busy 的唯一時點。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 1,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "句子沒有 always。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 2,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "was 不把狀態放到 Friday 之後。"
